    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0390_sister_12",
      "hash64": "CCC83F1E99C3847C",
      "text": "Hm. Schmollt er jetzt schon wieder, oder was?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0390_sister_13",
      "hash64": "CCC8401E99C3862F",
      "text": "Egal, ich kann ihn ja schlecht zu seinem Glück\\nzwingen. Machen wir halt zu zweit weiter![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0390_sister_14",
      "hash64": "CCC83D1E99C38116",
      "text": "Du darfst entscheiden, wohin wir zuerst\\naufbrechen.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0390_sister_15",
      "hash64": "CCC83E1E99C382C9",
      "text": "Keine Sorge, Ogerpon. Wir werden all deine\\nMasken zurückholen, verlass dich drauf![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
